ype": "text"}], "selected": 0}]}]}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le11ob08re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn5le11ob08re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "", "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn5le11ob08re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "Dear Vanessa,<br><br>I have to tell you about our experience on the hectic streets of Cairo!", "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn5le11ob08re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "The driver was swerving through the busy, congested streets when we came across a frightening accident.", "time": "6000"}, {"image": "engenn5le11ob08re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "A young boy was lying on the road.  He was conscious but not moving. His mother was sitting beside him, crying and holding his head as we arrived.  People were gathered around.  The driver of the car who hit the boy was having an argument with a group of men. My driver stopped to help.  The child looked up at us and pointed to his leg.", "time": "13000"}, {"image": "engenn5le11ob08re2img05.jpg", "id": 4, "text": "There was a large gash from the back of  his knee to the bottom of his calf.  One of the tourists took off their T-shirt and wrapped it tightly.  We then bundled him up and carried him to the waiting car.  We took off towards the local hospital. We have since heard from the hospital that he is being well looked after. It was an unforgettable experience.\n<br><br>\nSal xoxo", "time": "35000"}], "coverimg": "engenn5le11ob08re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": ""}, {"id": 2, "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "", "id": 0, "text": "", "time": "0"}, {"image": "", "id": 1, "text": "Writing a Paragraph about an Accident Or Injury", "time": "5000"}, {"image": "", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"bullet\">include a subject line and a greeting", "time": "18000"}, {"image": "", "id": 3, "text": "<span cl